# The Old Man and the Harpoon (adoulin, call-only): a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin, SoA Pioneer Registration
# current. Talks in pairs (the default first, then the script). Jorin (560): a trade while available: no onTrade,
# nothing. Available: 2540, finished: added, the Broken Harpoon. Accepted without the Extravagant Harpoon: 2541.
# Shipilolo (526): Pioneer Registration current (6, below Life on the Frontier): his script's mission test fails:
# nothing. Pioneer Registration completed (its 535 replaceDefault from then on) and Life on the Frontier current
# (GMs), accepted with the Broken Harpoon: 2543, finished: the Broken Harpoon taken, the Extravagant Harpoon given;
# then nothing. Jorin: 2542, finished: completed (the raw completeQuest), 500 exp, 300 bayld, BAYLD_OBTAINED, the
# Extravagant Harpoon taken, 30 Adoulin fame. Completed: Jorin nothing; Shipilolo with a Broken Harpoon (a GM):
# nothing.
lists WesternAdoulin/Jorin/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Shipilolo/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2540 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2542 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2543
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=93.8,32,152.2 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Soa PioneerRegistration current
item FlintStone
login
trade Jorin FlintStone x1               # available: no onTrade: nothing, the stone kept
trigger Jorin                           # 560
finish-if-event
trigger Jorin                           # available: 2540
finish-if-event                         # 2540's finish: added, the Broken Harpoon
trigger Jorin                           # 560
finish-if-event
trigger Jorin                           # accepted, no Extravagant Harpoon: 2541
finish-if-event
warp 86,0,-60.6 WesternAdoulin          # beside Shipilolo
trigger Shipilolo                       # 526
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # Pioneer Registration current: his script plays nothing: 526
finish-if-event
mission Soa PioneerRegistration completed   # a GM
mission Soa LifeOnTheFrontier current   # a GM
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # the Broken Harpoon: 2543
finish-if-event                         # 2543's finish: the Broken Harpoon taken, the Extravagant Harpoon given
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # no Broken Harpoon: nothing from the quests: 535
finish-if-event
warp 93.8,32,152.2 WesternAdoulin       # beside Jorin
trigger Jorin                           # 560
finish-if-event
trigger Jorin                           # the Extravagant Harpoon: 2542
finish-if-event                         # 2542's finish: completed, exp, bayld, BAYLD_OBTAINED, the harpoon taken, fame
trigger Jorin                           # 560
finish-if-event
trigger Jorin                           # completed: nothing: 560
finish-if-event
warp 86,0,-60.6 WesternAdoulin          # beside Shipilolo
keyitem BrokenHarpoon                   # a GM
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # completed with the Broken Harpoon: nothing: 535
finish-if-event
